        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_PRO/Scenes/Missions/CoastalTown/_scene_octopus.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 68a957ea-36c3-4233-bdbd-c892bd032e05).Image",
        "Description": "//server.listen( );\r\r//Contract 1-03-8111809-06\r\rIt has come to my attention that Lisa Almestoy, a money launderer under the guise of a local florist, has set a meeting with Orlando Siciliano and Maria DeLaurentis, who are both involved in black market organ trafficking, in the region. Adalberto Valassi, a known contractor, is believed to be in Almestoy&apos;s employ, disguised as a tourist. The chance to prune this particular garden, is simply too good to pass up. Good luck 47.\r\r//response.end( );",
